#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.rst:2
msgid "eigh"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:1
msgid "Compute eigenvalues and eigenvectors of a symmetric/Hermitian matrix."
msgstr "対称行列（エルミート行列）の固有値と固有ベクトルを計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:3
msgid ""
"This function computes the eigenvalues and eigenvectors of a real "
"symmetric or complex Hermitian matrix. The eigenvalues are returned in "
"ascending order, and the corresponding eigenvectors are normalized. This "
"implementation uses NumPy for CPU tensors and CuPy for CUDA tensors."
msgstr "この関数は、実対称行列または複素エルミート行列の固有値と固有ベクトルを計算します。固有値は昇順に返され、対応する固有ベクトルは正規化されます。この実装では、CPU テンソルには NumPy を、CUDA テンソルには CuPy を使用しています。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:9
msgid "This function does not support automatic differentiation (autograd)."
msgstr "この関数は自動微分（autograd）をサポートしていません。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:12
msgid ""
"The symmetry of the input is not validated. Only the triangular part "
"selected by :attr:`uplo` is used and the other part is ignored, so a non-"
"symmetric input silently yields the result for a different (symmetrized) "
"matrix."
msgstr "入力の対称性は検証されません。:attr:`uplo` で選択された三角部分のみが使用され、もう一方の部分は無視されるため、非対称な入力を与えると、（対称化された）別の行列に対する結果が警告なく返されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:18
msgid ""
"A symmetric (if real) or Hermitian (if complex) matrix of shape ``(..., "
"N, N)``. Only the upper or lower triangular part is used, depending on "
"the :attr:`uplo` parameter."
msgstr "形状が ``(..., N, N)`` の対称行列（実数の場合）またはエルミート行列（複素数の場合）。:attr:`uplo` パラメータに応じて、上三角部分または下三角部分が使用されます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:23
msgid ""
"Indicates which triangular part of the matrix is used:  - 'L' or 'l': Use"
" the lower triangular part (default) - 'U' or 'u': Use the upper "
"triangular part"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:23
msgid "Indicates which triangular part of the matrix is used:"
msgstr "使用する行列の三角部分を示します："

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:25
msgid "'L' or 'l': Use the lower triangular part (default)"
msgstr "'L' または 'l': 下三角部分を使用する（デフォルト）"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:26
msgid "'U' or 'u': Use the upper triangular part"
msgstr "'U' または 'u': 上三角部分を使用する"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:29
msgid ""
"A tuple containing:  - Eigenvalues: A tensor of shape ``(..., N)`` "
"containing   eigenvalues in ascending order - Eigenvectors: A tensor of "
"shape ``(..., N, N)`` where the columns   are the normalized eigenvectors"
" corresponding to the eigenvalues"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:29
msgid "A tuple containing:"
msgstr "以下の要素を含むタプル:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:31
msgid ""
"Eigenvalues: A tensor of shape ``(..., N)`` containing eigenvalues in "
"ascending order"
msgstr "固有値: 昇順に並んだ固有値を含む形状 ``(..., N)`` のテンソル"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:33
msgid ""
"Eigenvectors: A tensor of shape ``(..., N, N)`` where the columns are the"
" normalized eigenvectors corresponding to the eigenvalues"
msgstr "固有ベクトル: 形状が ``(..., N, N)`` のテンソルで、列は対応する固有値の正規化固有ベクトルです"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:38
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:40
msgid ""
">>> # Create a symmetric matrix\n"
">>> A = torch.tensor([[4.0, -2.0],\n"
"...                   [-2.0, 3.0]])\n"
">>> eigenvalues, eigenvectors = QF.eigh(A)\n"
">>> eigenvalues\n"
"tensor([1.4384, 5.5616])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 対称行列を作成\n"
">>> A = torch.tensor([[4.0, -2.0],\n"
"...                   [-2.0, 3.0]])\n"
">>> eigenvalues, eigenvectors = QF.eigh(A)\n"
">>> eigenvalues\n"
"tensor([1.4384, 5.5616])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:47
msgid ""
">>> # Verify: A @ v = λ @ v\n"
">>> torch.allclose(A @ eigenvectors, eigenvectors @ "
"torch.diag(eigenvalues))\n"
"True"
msgstr ""
">>> # 検証: A @ v = λ @ v\n"
">>> torch.allclose(A @ eigenvectors, eigenvectors @ "
"torch.diag(eigenvalues))\n"
"True"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:51
msgid ""
">>> # Using upper triangular part\n"
">>> B = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [0.0, 4.0, 5.0],\n"
"...                   [0.0, 0.0, 6.0]])\n"
">>> eigenvalues, eigenvectors = QF.eigh(B, uplo='U')"
msgstr ""
">>> # 上三角部分を使用\n"
">>> B = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [0.0, 4.0, 5.0],\n"
"...                   [0.0, 0.0, 6.0]])\n"
">>> eigenvalues, eigenvectors = QF.eigh(B, uplo='U')"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:57
msgid ""
":func:`nanpca`: NaN-aware principal component analysis using this "
"function."
msgstr ":func:`nanpca`: この関数を使用する、NaN を考慮した主成分分析。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.eigh.eigh:59
msgid "``torch.linalg.eigh``: PyTorch's built-in eigendecomposition."
msgstr "``torch.linalg.eigh``: PyTorch に組み込まれた固有値分解。"

